A '''region''' of the [[Core Worlds]] [[planet]] [[Alderaan]] contained the famous [[mountain]] known as [[Appenza Peak]], as well as the [[capital]] [[city]] [[Aldera]]. The region had a [[Unidentified flag|flag]] that bore the image of the mountain.<ref name="Princess of Alderaan" /> Along with the rest of the [[planet]], it was [[Destruction of Alderaan|destroyed]]<ref name="ANH">{{Film|IV}}</ref> in [[1 BBY]]<ref name="Date" /> when the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] [[battle station]] fired on Alderaan.<ref name="ANH" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The region first appeared in the [[2005]] film [[Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith|''Star Wars'': Episode III ''Revenge of the Sith'']].<ref name="ROTS">{{Film|III}}</ref> It was first described as a unique region in the [[2017]] novel ''[[Leia, Princess of Alderaan]]'', written by [[Claudia Gray]].<ref name="Princess of Alderaan" />

